- I mean, Bright Trip, which is

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.710
the company that we started
a year and a half ago,

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:40.740
is basically what I do on this channel,

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:43.370
but applied to a ton of people

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:45.860
making that type of work,
